# face generation working set (tools/faces/generate_faces.py + package_faces.py)
# raw/ = 2.9 GB of source PNG renders; out/ = the packaged copy, which is
# committed under dynasty/dynasty/Resources/Faces/ instead (byte-identical).
# tools/faces/manifest.json IS tracked — it is the (seed, bucket) ledger the
# cull/regen loop needs.
tools/faces/raw/
tools/faces/out/
tools/faces/__pycache__/
# raw_extras/ = ~120 MB of source PNG renders for the AI-portrait extras (the 20
# user personas + 96 owner executives). Same deal as raw/: the culled, packaged
# HEICs + extra_faces_manifest.json are committed under
# dynasty/dynasty/Resources/Faces/ instead.
tools/faces/raw_extras/

# league-data source scrape cache (tools/league-data/build_raw.py) — 725 MB of
# HTML/CSV snapshots, a fetch cache and a nested Xcode build dir. The refined
# tools/league-data/raw/*.json that make_templates.py + scan_bundle.py read IS
# tracked.
tools/league-data/raw/_sources/

# make_templates.py build products — byte-identical (cmp-verified) to the
# bundled copies under dynasty/dynasty/Resources/. TRANSFORM_QA.md in the same
# directory IS tracked.
tools/league-data/out/league_2026_dev.json
tools/league-data/out/league_2026_publish.json
